
---

# 📄 ✅ `.gitignore`

Create file `.gitignore` and paste:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Virtual Environment
venv/
env/

# Environment Variables
.env

# Model Files
*.pkl

# Logs
*.log

# OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# VS Code
.vscode/

# PyCharm
.idea/

# Docker
*.env
